Hero Zulkis Dies
    Events
        Unit - A unit owned by Player 1 (Red) Dies
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to Zulkis
    Actions
        Custom script:   local string a
        Custom script:   local string b
        Custom script:   local string c
        Custom script:   local string d
        -------- ======================= --------
        Custom script:   set a = "|cffffcc00"
        Custom script:   set b = GetHeroProperName(GetTriggerUnit())
        Custom script:   set c = "|r has |cffff0000died..|r"
        Custom script:   set d = a + b + c
        -------- ======================= --------
        Custom script:   call ShowSingleLineText(d, 0.5, 3, 1.5, 1.5)
        -------- ======================= --------
        Set VariableSet ZulkisDead = True
        -------- Start timer --------
        Countdown Timer - Start ReviveTimerZulkis as a One-shot timer that will expire in 30.00 seconds
        -------- Drop items --------
        Hero - Drop the item from slot 1 of (Dying unit).
        Hero - Drop the item from slot 2 of (Dying unit).
        Hero - Drop the item from slot 3 of (Dying unit).
        Hero - Drop the item from slot 4 of (Dying unit).
        Hero - Drop the item from slot 5 of (Dying unit).
        Hero - Drop the item from slot 6 of (Dying unit).
        Set VariableSet ZulkisDeathPoint = (Position of (Dying unit))
        Set VariableSet ZulkisDeathRegion = (Region centered at ZulkisDeathPoint with size (300.00, 300.00))
        -------- Death Camera --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        NazgrekDead Equal to False
                        And - All (Conditions) are true
                            Conditions
                                ZulkisDead Equal to True
                                NazgrekDead Equal to True
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet DeathCameraPoint = ZulkisDeathPoint
                Trigger - Run Death Camera <gen> (ignoring conditions)
            Else - Actions
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_ZulkisDeathPoint)
        Trigger - Remove (This trigger) from the trigger queue
